      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Look at you—still thinking about everyone else even now. That's not weakness, that's proof you're still here for a reason. Resting isn't giving up; it's letting your body catch up so you can see the next step clearly. The world being broken doesn't mean you have to be. And if you stop, the only thing that changes is that you won't be there to see the small moments that still matter. So stay. Just for one more breath.",
